    captions: [[0.0, "Two teams line up on the west sideline: blue north of the cone, red south of it. The coach stands just behind the cone."], [0.6, "The coach rolls a ball out, about 9 yards along the 20-yard line."], [1.0, "Two red players and one blue player, the ones closest to the cone, go for it."], [2.3, "They fight for the ground ball."], [2.9, "Red scoops it. Keep-away starts: 2 red against 1 blue, so blue is a player down."], [12.9, "The coach blows the whistle once: release! The next player from each team joins."], [14.1, "Now 3 red against 2 blue, so blue is a player down. Same job: one defender on the ball, the others cover the open players."], [22.9, "The coach blows the whistle once: release! The next player from each team joins."], [24.1, "Now 4 red against 3 blue, so blue is a player down. Same job: one defender on the ball, the others cover the open players."], [31.9, "The coach blows the whistle once: release! The next player from each team joins."], [33.1, "Now 5 red against 4 blue, so blue is a player down. Same job: one defender on the ball, the others cover the open players."], [40.9, "The coach counts down: 5"], [41.9, "The coach counts down: 4"], [42.9, "The coach counts down: 3"], [43.9, "The coach counts down: 2"], [43.9, "The pass is dropped. The ball is loose."], [44.9, "The coach counts down: 1"], [45.9, "Time! Nobody has the ball, so nobody wins the round. The coach calls reset."]],
